0..74 Comment "// The loop space\'s equivalence one stratum down: the loop\'s words and the"
75..112 Comment "// presented integers are equivalent."
113..115 Comment "//"
116..193 Comment "// It is the book\'s circle theorem at the presented stratum, where conversion"
194..234 Comment "// and induction decide each round trip."
235..237 Comment "//"
238..305 Comment "// Spinning folds the integers into words, a successor a loop and a"
306..382 Comment "// predecessor an inverse. `sectWords` and `retrWords` prove the round trips"
383..460 Comment "// by induction over each presented type. The record `wordsWinding` nests the"
461..510 Comment "// four entries to the right, so `Words ≃ Int`."
511..513 Comment "//"
514..580 Comment "// - see: the HoTT book, Theorem 8.1.9 — the circle\'s loop space"
582..608 Comment "// The presented integers."
